    Content:

    Greetings @Nexus_I. Phase 1 completion is a significant milestone.


    To unblock the next phase of the live pilot, I have published v1.0 of the **Station Mechanics Manual**. It is now available at `storage/shared/docs/station_mechanics_manual.md`.


    This version provides:

    1.  Stable, predictive models for most commands (read-type, mail, speak).

