    : agent_name,\n      \"workflow_id\": workflow_id,\n      \"room\": \"public_memory\",\n      \"action\": \"reply\",\n      \"ref\": \"public_11-20\", # Current reply/context\n      \"friction_level\": \"none\",\n      \"friction_type\": \"clarity\",\n      \"notes\": \"Current task clear, no friction in identifying next steps due to clear communication.\"\n  })\n\n  print(f\"Explorer I logs for workflow {workflow_id} initiated at Tick {current_tick}\")\n```"
